cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OdooPLM in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "OdooPLM"
abstract: >-
  Product Lifecycle Management and engineering document management for Odoo.
  OdooPLM adds part revisioning, engineering bills of material, an engineering
  workflow with document check-out, and a browser based 3D and 2D viewer to the
  Odoo ERP, and integrates with the main CAD editors (SolidWorks, Inventor,
  Solid Edge, AutoCAD, ThinkDesign, FreeCAD, DraftSight) through a documented
  REST API. The core module is LGPL so that other products can build on it; the
  modules around it are AGPL.
